  - m_Id: 6665832888717320
    m_Localized: Each player has a Planeswalker card as their "Oathbreaker" which
      can be cast at any time and determines deck colors. Each player also has a
      signature spell that can be cast when their Oathbreaker is on the battlefield.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832888717321
    m_Localized: Each player has a Planeswalker card which can be cast at any time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832888717322
    m_Localized: Each player has a deck containing 60 basic lands and the Momir Vig
      avatar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832888717323
    m_Localized: Each player has a deck containing 60 basic lands and the Momir Vig,
      Jhoira of the Ghitu, and Stonehewer Giant avatars.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832888717324
    m_Localized: Each player has a legendary "General" card which can be cast at
      any time and determines deck colors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832888717325
    m_Localized: Each player has a legendary "General" card which can be cast at
      any time and determines deck colors. Each card must have mana value less than
      4.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832888717326
    m_Localized: Each player has a legendary "General" card which can be cast at
      any time and determines deck colors. Only cards legal in Standard may be used.
