    m_Localized: How many booster packs?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832922271747
    m_Localized: How many cards do you want to draw?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832922271748
    m_Localized: How many copies of {0}?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832922271749
    m_Localized: How many opponents are you willing to face?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832922271750
    m_Localized: How many?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832922271751
    m_Localized: Human
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832922271752
    m_Localized: I let my army do the talking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832922271753
    m_Localized: I prefer mana from more artificial sources.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832922271754
    m_Localized: I'm not really an animal person.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832922271755
    m_Localized: If enabled, AI Compatible Decks will be automatically selected for
      AI Player when Random Deck is pressed (If you have performance issue, disable
      this option).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832922271756
    m_Localized: If enabled, Card Art in Decks will be automatically optimized to
      match up with card frames, editions and multiple art illustrations.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832922271757
    m_Localized: If enabled, the OK and Cancel Prompt buttons are reversed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832922271758
    m_Localized: If enabled, the custom drafts files are preloaded on startup (Forge
      will have longer startup time when parsing drafts files).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832922271759
    m_Localized: If turned on, Forge will load all archived format definitions, this
      may take slightly longer to load at startup. (REQUIRES RESTART)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832922271760
    m_Localized: 'If turned on, Forge will load card scripts as they''re needed instead
      of at start up. (DISABLED: PROBLEMATIC)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832922271761
    m_Localized: If you do
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832922271762
    m_Localized: 'If you leave now, this tournament will be forever gone.

      You
      will keep the cards you drafted, but will receive no other prizes.


      Would
      you still like to quit the tournament?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
