  - m_Id: 6665832922271772
    m_Localized: In Draft mode, three booster packs are rotated around eight players.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832922271773
    m_Localized: In Gauntlet mode, you select a deck and play against multiple opponents.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832922271774
    m_Localized: In Quest mode, you build a deck from a limited inventory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832922271775
    m_Localized: In Sealed mode, you build a deck from booster packs (maximum 10).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665832922271776
    m_Localized: In this mode, you will start with a clean battlefield and empty
      zones.
