  - m_Id: 6665833039712301
    m_Localized: Then, play against one or all of the AI opponents.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833039712302
    m_Localized: Then, switch to the Duels or Challenges submenu to play against
      AI opponents and unlock more cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833048100864
    m_Localized: Then, try to beat all AI opponents without losing a match.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833048100865
    m_Localized: Then, use the Dump Game State command to export your game state
      with metadata template.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833048100866
    m_Localized: Then, you may play against each of the AI opponents, or one of the
      opponents.
