  - m_Id: 6665833060683785
    m_Localized: Waiting for actions...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833060683786
    m_Localized: Waiting for opponent...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833060683787
    m_Localized: 'Welcome to the Create a Puzzle mode.


      Please make sure that
      Developer Mode is enabled in Forge preferences.

      Remember that rule enforcement
      is active, so players will lose the game

      for drawing from empty library!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833060683788
    m_Localized: What type of name do you want to generate?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833060683789
    m_Localized: When checked, this order is applied automatically each time these
      choices appear together later this game (no dialog shown). Use Game -> Reset
      Saved Orders to forget all saved orders.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833060683790
    m_Localized: When enabled clones will use their original art instead of the cloned
      card's art.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833060683791
    m_Localized: When enabled, Cache size are automatically determined on startup.
      (If unsure, turn OFF this option)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833060683792
    m_Localized: When enabled, Escape key functions as an alternative shortcut to
      end the current turn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833060683793
    m_Localized: When enabled, Forge pauses when minimized (primarily for AI vs AI).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833060683794
    m_Localized: When enabled, Forge will not display card images.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833060683795
    m_Localized: When enabled, Preloads Extended Art Cards to Cache on Startup (High
      RAM usage).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833060683796
    m_Localized: When enabled, automatically check snapshot updates on startup and
      displays the notification on the title bar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833060683797
    m_Localized: When enabled, automatically submits bug reports to developers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833060683798
    m_Localized: When enabled, detailed spell/ability descriptions are shown when
      choosing targets and paying costs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833060683799
    m_Localized: When enabled, displays the current storm count in the prompt pane.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833060683800
    m_Localized: When enabled, disposes the card art and card image caches to save
      RAM during game screen switching. (If unsure, turn OFF this option)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833060683801
    m_Localized: When enabled, flashes the player choice area upon receiving priority.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833064878080
    m_Localized: When enabled, show the FPS Display (Experimental).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833064878081
    m_Localized: When enabled, show the scroll indicator on the match screen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833064878082
    m_Localized: When enabled, the card corners are rounded (Preferably Card with
      Full Borders).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833064878083
    m_Localized: When enabled, you get a warning if passing priority would cause
      you to lose mana in your mana pool.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833064878084
    m_Localized: When it's the last spell you ever cast, you better make it count!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833064878085
    m_Localized: When opening Fat Packs and Booster Boxes, booster packs will be
      opened and displayed one at a time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833064878086
    m_Localized: When render card images, skip rendering reminder text.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833064878087
    m_Localized: When selected, artifacts will be included in your pool regardless
      of color selections. This mimics the old card pool behavior.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833064878088
    m_Localized: When showing only unique cards, prefer a printing confirmed to exist
      in your card image language over the default art selection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833064878089
    m_Localized: When starting a game with 2 human players, use single prompt to
      control both players.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833064878090
    m_Localized: When using card color filters, filter lands in a way to make it
      easier to find relevant mana producing lands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833064878091
    m_Localized: When your starting pool is generated, duplicates of cards may be
      included.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833064878092
    m_Localized: Whenever possible, prefer card arts gathered from Core, Expansion,
      and Reprint Sets (e.g. No Promo, No Online Editions).
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
