    m_Localized: You have found the following cards inside
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833081655300
    m_Localized: You have mana floating in your mana pool that could be lost if you
      pass priority now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833081655301
    m_Localized: 'You have matches left to play!

      Leaving the tournament early
      will forfeit your potential future winnings.

      You will still receive
      winnings as if you conceded your next match and you will keep the cards you
      drafted.


      Would you still like to quit the tournament?'
