    m_Localized: You have not selected a deck to start.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6665833081655303
    m_Localized: 'You have uncompleted challenges in your current world. If you travel
      now, they will be LOST!

      Are you sure you wish to travel anyway?

      (Click
      "No" to go back and complete your current challenges first.)'
